":"LE_lADOAgUK288AAAABRxHT-88AAAAHT674dg","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/events/31401638006","actor":{"login":"shahar1","id":60007259,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMDA3MjU5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60007259?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1","html_url":"https://github.com/shahar1","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shahar1/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2026-09-18T16:03:21Z","label":{"name":"needs-triage","color":"b60205"},"intent":null,"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5761337628","html_url":"https://github.com/apache/airflow/issues/73285#issuecomment-5761337628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/73285","id":5761337628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAgUK288AAAABV2cJHA","user":{"login":"namanjain24-sudo","id":180642416,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsRicA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180642416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain24-sudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-21T13:32:58Z","updated_at":"2026-09-21T13:32:58Z","body":"Some observations from the current code that may help when choosing the shape (no preference between the options from my side):\n\n- In deferrable mode `AwsTaskLogFetcher` is not what forwards the logs for ECS: `TaskDoneTrigger._forward_logs` polls CloudWatch itself inside the triggerer, and a callable cannot be handed to a trigger since its kwargs are stored serialized. For Batch, `execute_complete` builds a fetcher and reads the last messages once after the job has ended (`get_last_log_messages(10000)`), so a callback there would receive everything at once instead of while the job runs. An `on_log_event` parameter would therefore only behave as described with `deferrable=False`, unless it takes a serializable form such as an import path, or the limitation is documented.\n- `AwsTaskLogFetcher.run()` calls `self.logger.log(...)` in a loop without exception handling. An exception raised by a user callback would end that background thread without failing the task, and log fetching would silently stop, so the callback call would need to be wrapped and its errors logged.\n\n---\nDrafted-by: a Gen-AI coding assistant (no human review before posting)\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/apache/airflow/issues/comments/5761337628/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"namanjain24-sudo","id":180642416,"node_id":"U_kgDOCsRicA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180642416?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain24-sudo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain24-sudo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}}]]
